Build the overlay sources the S10 build listed by hand in its local xnu tree
(B1L-0113 b2l_prof.c, 0140 B2LWifi, 0152 HakiOS network, 0163 b2l_wpa.c,
0202 b2l_ccsha1_ltc.c, 0210 B2LBluetooth) and start B2LWifi and B2LBluetooth
on IOResources, as docs/bluetooth/plan.md describes.

